  "details": "Let users set custom spawn points in worlds as an alternative option to just joining a world. \n\nYou can make this a feature that world creators can allow in their world properties and make it so that any time that the world is updated that the spawn point resets to prevent issues with spawning into walls and such.\n\nCould look something like this in the UI (sorry for scuffed ps edit)",
